          "date": "2026-08-26 08:36:52.000000000",
          "tz": 120
        },
        "subject": "LU-10026 ofd: don't write blocks after compressed size",
        "message": "LU-10026 ofd: don't write blocks after compressed size\n\ndue to limits in ib/rdma/lnet, client has to send full pages.\nif client's pagesize is bigger then server's pagesize, then\nwe want to skip writing useless bytes from those full pages\ncontaining compressed data.\n\nTest-Parameters: forjanitoronly\nDDN-bug-id: EX-10712\nSigned-off-by: Alex Zhuravlev <bzzz@whamcloud.com>\nSigned-off-by: Marc Vef <mvef@whamcloud.com>\nChange-Id: I61c6fe72af1d2e8679d9fde303a561e80a287746\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
